templateVersions.content:
Retrieve details from Parcel__c where Parcel_ID__c matches user input. Return response in this format:

Parcel Tracking Update

- Parcel Name: {!$Input:objectToSummarize.Name}
- Parcel ID: {!$Input:objectToSummarize.Parcel_ID__c}
- Status: {!$Input:objectToSummarize.Status__c}
- Weight: {!$Input:objectToSummarize.Weight__c}
- Estimated Delivery Date: {!$Input:objectToSummarize.Estimated_Delivery_Date__c}
